flowchart TD
    subgraph Choreography Saga
        A1[Service A: Start Transaction] --> B1[Emit Event ACompleted]
        B1 --> C1[Service B: Execute Step]
        C1 --> D1[Emit Event BCompleted]
        D1 --> E1[Service C: Execute Step]
        E1 --> F1[Emit Event CCompleted]
        C1 -.failure.-> G1[Emit Event BFailed]
        G1 --> H1[Service A Compensation]
    end

    subgraph Orchestration Saga
        A2[Saga Orchestrator] --> B2[Command Service A]
        B2 --> C2[Command Service B]
        C2 --> D2[Command Service C]
        C2 -.failure.-> E2[Orchestrator Runs Compensation]
        E2 --> F2[Rollback Service A]
    end
